  "title": "OnDeck Releases Q1 2026 Small Business Cash Flow Trend Report",
  "summary": "Small businesses are maintaining strong momentum in 2026, with sustained confidence in growth, increasing use of AI and continued reliance on flexible financing options, according to the latest Small Business Cash Flow Trend Report from OnDeck, a market leader in small business lending, and Ocrolus, an AI workflow and cash flow analytics platform for lenders.",
